{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"posts\":[{\"id\":17051,\"date\":\"2026-08-21T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-21T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"codice-macos-nuova-casa-apple-homepad-homepod-mini-2-videocamera\",\"title\":\"Il codice di macOS svela la nuova casa Apple: HomePad, HomePod mini 2 e una videocamera\",\"excerpt\":\"La Release Candidate di macOS 26.7 avrebbe rivelato nuovi dispositivi per la casa Apple: HomePad, HomePod mini 2, una videocamera di sicurezza e altri accessori non ancora annunciati.\",\"categoryName\":\"Smart Home\",\"categorySlug\":\"smart-home\",\"categoryId\":11,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/homepad-concept-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"homepad-concept\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17035,\"date\":\"2026-08-20T09:28:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-20T07:28:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-tv-4k-nuova-generazione-a17-pro-siri-ai-wi-fi-7\",\"title\":\"Apple TV 4K di nuova generazione: chip A17 Pro, Siri AI e Wi‑Fi 7\",\"excerpt\":\"I rumor indicano almeno cinque novità per la prossima Apple TV 4K: chip A17 Pro (o più recente), più RAM, Siri AI su tvOS 27, chip N1 con Wi‑Fi 7 e un nuovo Siri Remote.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/apple-tv-4k-yellow-bg-feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"apple-tv-4k-yellow-bg-feature\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16949,\"date\":\"2026-08-14T14:55:34+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-14T12:55:34+00:00\",\"slug\":\"cosa-aspettarsi-a-settembre-nuovi-iphone-apple-watch-e-novita-ai\",\"title\":\"Cosa aspettarsi a settembre: nuovi iPhone, Apple Watch e possibili novità AI\",\"excerpt\":\"Settembre potrebbe portare almeno cinque nuovi dispositivi all’evento incentrato su iPhone: iPhone 18 Pro e Pro Max, il primo iPhone pieghevole (“Ultra”), Apple Watch Series 12 e Ultra 4. In parallelo, Apple potrebbe estendere l’integrazione Siri AI anche ad altri prodotti.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/iPhone-18-Pro-Rumored-Colors-768x384.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iPhone-18-Pro-Rumored-Colors\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16895,\"date\":\"2026-08-13T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-13T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-18-pro-base-storage-256gb-nessun-aumento\",\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro: base storage a 256GB, nessun aumento rispetto al 17 Pro\",\"excerpt\":\"Per iPhone 18 Pro si parla di un taglio di partenza da 256GB, stesso livello minimo di iPhone 17 Pro. Nonostante ciò, i prezzi potrebbero salire per l’aumento dei costi dei componenti.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/iPhone-18-Pro-Dark-Cherry-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iPhone-18-Pro-Dark-Cherry-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16873,\"date\":\"2026-08-12T08:22:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-12T06:22:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-18-pro-costo-componenti-38-memoria\",\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro, costo componenti +38%: pesa soprattutto la memoria\",\"excerpt\":\"Per iPhone 18 Pro (256GB) il costo dei componenti sarebbe circa il 38% più alto rispetto a iPhone 17 Pro, con l’aumento guidato dai prezzi della memoria.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/Four-iPhone-18-Pro-Colors-Mock-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Four-iPhone-18-Pro-Colors-Mock-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16890,\"date\":\"2026-08-11T22:50:23+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-11T20:50:23+00:00\",\"slug\":\"tvos-27-watchos-27-terze-beta-pubbliche\",\"title\":\"tvOS 27 e watchOS 27: disponibili le terze beta pubbliche\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple rilascia le terze beta pubbliche di tvOS 27 e watchOS 27, con novità su Siri AI, Smart Stack, Find My e miglioramenti per Apple TV e HomePod.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/watchos-27-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"watchos-27\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16664,\"date\":\"2026-08-01T09:06:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-01T07:06:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"come-apple-e-cambiata-con-tim-cook-15-anni-in-numeri\",\"title\":\"Come Apple è cambiata con Tim Cook: 15 anni in numeri\",\"excerpt\":\"Dai ricavi al valore di Borsa, dalla base installata alle subscription: ecco i principali numeri che raccontano l’evoluzione di Apple negli ultimi 15 anni, tra leadership di Tim Cook e passaggio di consegne a John Ternus.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/Tim-Cook-Apple-Park-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Tim-Cook-Apple-Park\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16588,\"date\":\"2026-07-30T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-30T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-nuove-generazioni-apple-tv-homepod-mini-home-hub-siri-ai\",\"title\":\"Apple prepara nuove generazioni di Apple TV, HomePod mini e un Home Hub con Siri AI\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple sarebbe pronta a lanciare una nuova Apple TV, una nuova versione di HomePod mini e un inedito Home Hub con display da 7 pollici e Siri AI.\",\"categoryName\":\"Smart Home\",\"categorySlug\":\"smart-home\",\"categoryId\":11,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/Home-Hub-Command-Center-with-Dome-Base-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Home-Hub-Command-Center-with-Dome-Base-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16509,\"date\":\"2026-07-25T09:33:31+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-25T07:33:31+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-nuovi-aggiornamenti-icloud-home-siri-foto\",\"title\":\"iOS 27 e i nuovi aggiornamenti iCloud: Home, Siri, Foto e altro\",\"excerpt\":\"iOS 27 porta nuove funzioni iCloud in più app: riassunti intelligenti per le videocamere HomeKit Secure Video, miglioramenti a upload e condivisione in Foto, nuove opzioni di collaborazione e aggiornamenti per Siri, Journal e Password.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/iOS-27-All-the-New-iCloud-Features-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-27-All-the-New-iCloud-Features\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16446,\"date\":\"2026-07-23T09:28:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-23T07:28:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"tvos-27-watchos-27-seconde-beta-pubbliche\",\"title\":\"tvOS 27 e watchOS 27: disponibili le seconde beta pubbliche\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha rilasciato le seconde beta pubbliche di tvOS 27 e watchOS 27, con novità su Siri AI, Smart Stack, Find My e miglioramenti per Apple TV. In arrivo anche una beta per HomePod e HomePod mini.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/watchos-27-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"watchos-27\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16281,\"date\":\"2026-07-17T08:22:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-17T06:22:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-2026-smart-home-lineup-nuovo-apple-tv-homepod-home-hub\",\"title\":\"Apple nel 2026 punta sulla smart home: nuovo Apple TV, HomePod e Home Hub\",\"excerpt\":\"Una nuova linea per la smart home Apple nel 2026: aggiornamenti per Apple TV, HomePod e l’arrivo di un Home Hub pensato per centralizzare e gestire l’ecosistema domestico.\",\"categoryName\":\"Smart Home\",\"categorySlug\":\"smart-home\",\"categoryId\":11,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/Rumored-Home-Products-Thumb-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Rumored-Home-Products-Thumb\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16247,\"date\":\"2026-07-14T12:02:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-14T10:02:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"tvos-27-watchos-27-prime-beta-pubbliche-disponibili\",\"title\":\"tvOS 27 e watchOS 27: prime beta pubbliche disponibili\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple rilascia le prime beta pubbliche di tvOS 27 e watchOS 27, insieme a una beta di HomePod Software 27. Novità su Siri AI, Smart Stack, Find My e Apple Music.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/watchos-27-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"watchos-27\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16036,\"date\":\"2026-07-08T09:06:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-08T07:06:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-rilascia-beta-4-ios-26-6-e-altri-sistemi-cosa-aspettarsi\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia la beta 4 di iOS 26.6 e degli altri sistemi: cosa aspettarsi\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple mette a disposizione la quarta beta per sviluppatori di iOS 26.6, insieme alle nuove beta di iPadOS 26.6, macOS Tahoe 26.6, watchOS 26.6, tvOS 26.6 e HomePod 26.6.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/ios-26.6-beta-4-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"ios-26.6-beta-4\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15953,\"date\":\"2026-07-04T12:02:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-04T10:02:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-16-nuovi-prodotti-seconda-meta-2026\",\"title\":\"Apple, i rumor su 16 nuovi prodotti nella seconda metà del 2026\",\"excerpt\":\"Dopo l’arrivo in beta della nuova Siri più personale, i rumor indicano aggiornamenti per iPhone, Apple Watch, iPad, Mac e la piattaforma smart home: dal possibile iPhone Ultra pieghevole al nuovo Home Hub.\",\"categoryName\":\"Smart Home\",\"categorySlug\":\"smart-home\",\"categoryId\":11,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/Apple-Event-Logo-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Event-Logo\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":4,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15829,\"date\":\"2026-06-29T12:39:10+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-29T10:39:10+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-aumenta-prezzi-mac-ipad-apple-watch-homepod-apple-tv-italia-nuovi-importi\",\"title\":\"Apple aumenta i prezzi di Mac, iPad, Apple Watch, HomePod e Apple TV in Italia: ecco i nuovi importi\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple aggiorna i listini in Italia con nuovi prezzi per Mac, iPad, Apple Watch, HomePod e Apple TV. Ecco cosa cambia.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/apple-aumenta-prezzi-italia-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"apple-aumenta-prezzi-italia-1\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15740,\"date\":\"2026-06-26T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-26T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-home-app-nuove-funzioni-homekit-apple-intelligence\",\"title\":\"iOS 27 Home App: 10+ nuove funzioni HomeKit con Apple Intelligence\",\"excerpt\":\"Con iOS 27 la Home app introduce nuove funzioni basate su Apple Intelligence per HomeKit Secure Video: riassunti AI, raggruppamento dei filmati, ricerca in linguaggio naturale, anteprime e meno notifiche.\",\"categoryName\":\"Smart Home\",\"categorySlug\":\"smart-home\",\"categoryId\":11,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/iOS-27-10-HomeKit-Features-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-27-10-HomeKit-Features\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15512,\"date\":\"2026-06-15T08:22:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-15T06:22:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-taglia-frequenze-audio-keynote-wwdc-per-evitare-attivazioni-siri\",\"title\":\"Apple taglia frequenze audio nel keynote WWDC per evitare attivazioni di Siri\",\"excerpt\":\"Nel keynote WWDC 2026 Apple avrebbe modificato l’audio ogni volta che viene pronunciato “Siri”, rimuovendo bande tra 3 kHz e 6 kHz per ridurre le attivazioni accidentali dei dispositivi vicini.\",\"categoryName\":\"Smart Home\",\"categorySlug\":\"smart-home\",\"categoryId\":11,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/homepod-top-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"homepod-top\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15497,\"date\":\"2026-06-14T18:52:25+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-14T16:52:25+00:00\",\"slug\":\"homepod-migliora-con-ios-27-automix-airplay-piu-veloci\",\"title\":\"HomePod migliora con iOS 27: arrivano AutoMix e connessioni AirPlay più veloci\",\"excerpt\":\"Con iOS 27 HomePod riceve AutoMix e miglioramenti alle connessioni AirPlay, puntando a un’esperienza audio più fluida e stabile.\",\"categoryName\":\"Smart Home\",\"categorySlug\":\"smart-home\",\"categoryId\":11,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/homepod-2-top.jpg-768x384.webp\",\"imageAlt\":\"homepod-2-top.jpg\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15253,\"date\":\"2026-06-01T12:00:38+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-31T22:38:48+00:00\",\"slug\":\"nuovi-apple-tv-4k-homepod-mini-quasi-pronti-siri-aggiornata-attesa\",\"title\":\"Nuovi Apple TV 4K e HomePod mini “quasi pronti”: Siri aggiornata attesa\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Mark Gurman, Apple TV 4K e HomePod mini sarebbero pronti da mesi, ma il lancio slitterebbe finché non arriva Siri più personalizzata.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/HomePod-mini-and-Apple-TV-Sage-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"HomePod-mini-and-Apple-TV-Sage\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14059,\"date\":\"2026-03-26T21:33:17+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-03-26T20:33:17+00:00\",\"slug\":\"niente-grandi-cambiamenti-design-apple-watch-2026\",\"title\":\"Niente grandi cambiamenti di design per Apple Watch nel 2026\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Mark Gurman di Bloomberg, non sono attesi cambiamenti di design importanti per i prossimi modelli di Apple Watch in arrivo più tardi nel 2026.\",\"categoryName\":\"Watch\",\"categorySlug\":\"watch\",\"categoryId\":186,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/03/Apple-Watch-Series-10-Jet-Black-768x431.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Watch-Series-10-Jet-Black\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":13984,\"date\":\"2026-03-22T20:59:23+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-03-22T20:37:34+00:00\",\"slug\":\"nuova-apple-tv-homepod-mini-pronti-lancio\",\"title\":\"Nuova Apple TV e HomePod Mini Pronti per il Lancio\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha presentato nove nuovi prodotti questo mese, ma l'attesa continua per i modelli di Apple TV 4K e HomePod mini di nuova generazione.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/03/HomePod-mini-and-Apple-TV-Sage-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"HomePod mini and Apple TV Sage\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":13506,\"date\":\"2026-02-28T03:30:32+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-02-28T12:37:12+00:00\",\"slug\":\"cosa-aspettarsi-dalla-grande-settimana-di-apple\",\"title\":\"Cosa Aspettarsi dalla Grande Settimana di Apple: iPhone 17e, MacBook Economico, Nuovi iPad e Altro\",\"excerpt\":\"A partire da lunedì, Apple annuncerà i suoi primi importanti prodotti del 2026, tra cui l'iPhone 17e e un nuovo MacBook economico.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/02/Apple-Announces-Special-Event-in-New-York-Feature-1-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple Announces Special Event in New York Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":24,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":13301,\"date\":\"2026-02-17T11:30:13+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-02-21T10:30:24+00:00\",\"slug\":\"evento-apple-marzo-2026\",\"title\":\"Evento Apple del 4 marzo: Cosa Aspettarsi\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha invitato giornalisti e creatori di contenuti a un 'Apple Experience' speciale il 4 marzo a New York, Londra e Shanghai, dove potrebbero essere annunciati nuovi prodotti.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/02/Apple-Announces-Special-Event-in-New-York-Feature-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple Announces Special Event in New York Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":27,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":12646,\"date\":\"2026-01-26T00:09:46+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-01-25T23:09:46+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-home-hub-base-robotica-girevole\",\"title\":\"Il prossimo Home Hub di Apple potrebbe includere una 'base robotica girevole'\",\"excerpt\":\"Il dispositivo Home Hub che Apple prevede di lanciare in primavera avrà una 'base robotica girevole', secondo Wayne Ma di The Information.\",\"categoryName\":\"Smart Home\",\"categorySlug\":\"smart-home\",\"categoryId\":11,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/01/Home-Hub-Command-Center-with-Dome-Base-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Home Hub Command Center with Dome Base Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144